 nits, it delivers vibrant visuals and responsive interaction. Compatible with both Android and Windows OS, it supports versatile applications including wayfinding, menu boards, and self-service interfaces to enhance user engagement and operational efficiency.\", \"sku\": \"BL-DS-KSK43\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/digital-kiosk-interactive-43\", \"category\": \"digital-signage\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_digital-kiosk-interactive-43.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 500, \"highPrice\": 8000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/digital-kiosk-interactive-43\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"N/A\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"500 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Tb22,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the main technical specifications of the Digital Kiosk Interactive 43\\\"?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The kiosk features a 43-inch touchscreen with a 10-point capacitive touch panel, supports Android or Windows OS, and has a brightness of 500 nits for clear visibility in various lighting conditions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the Digital Kiosk suitable for indoor and outdoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This model is primarily designed for indoor use in controlled environments like malls, airports, hotels, and restaurants, as the 500-nit brightness is optimized for indoor ambient lighting rather than direct sunlight.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What type of touchscreen technology does this kiosk use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It utilizes a 10-point capacitive touchscreen, allowing for precise multi-touch interactions, which is ideal for interactive applications like wayfinding and menu browsing.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What operating systems are supported on the Digital Kiosk Interactive 43\\\"?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The kiosk supports both Android and Windows operating systems, offering flexibility depending on the required software applications and user interface.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this digital kiosk compare to standard non-interactive digital signage?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike standard digital signage that only displays content, this kiosk offers interactive functionality with touchscreen support, enabling users to actively engage with wayfinding, menus, or other self-service options.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for the freestanding interactive kiosk?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The kiosk is freestanding and requires a stable flat surface. It's designed for simple placement without complex installation, making it suitable for high-traffic public areas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and after-sales support are available for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides a standard warranty covering hardware and software issues for one year, with options for extended coverage and dedicated after-sales support for seamless operation.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the kiosk be customized for specific applications like hotel check-in or restaurant ordering?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the kiosk supports software customization to tailor the interface and functionality for various applications such as wayfinding, self-check-in, menu display, or ordering systems.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Digital Kiosk Interactive 43\\\\\\\"\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/digital-kiosk-interactive-43\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T756,<h1>Digital Kiosk Interactive 43&quot;</h1><p>Enhance customer engagement with our 43&quot; Interactive Digital Kiosk. Available now in Dubai, UAE. Order your smart kiosk today!</p><p><strong>Freestanding interactive kiosk. Touchscreen with wayfinding and menu boards.</strong></p><p>The Digital Kiosk Interactive 43&quot; is a freestanding touchscreen solution designed for dynamic indoor environments such as malls, airports, hotels, and restaurants. Featuring a 10-point capacitive touch panel and high brightness of 500 nits, it delivers vibrant visuals and responsive interaction. Compatible with both Android and Windows OS, it supports versatile applications including wayfinding, menu boards, and self-service interfaces to enhance user engagement and operational efficiency.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What are the main technical specifications of the Digital Kiosk Interactive 43&quot;?</h3><p>The kiosk features a 43-inch touchscreen with a 10-point capacitive touch panel, supports Android or Windows OS, and has a brightness of 500 nits for clear visibility in various lighting conditions.</p><h3>Is the Digital Kiosk suitable for indoor and outdoor use?</h3><p>This model is primarily designed for indoor use in controlled environments like malls, airports, hotels, and restaurants, as the 500-nit brightness is optimized for indoor ambient lighting rather than direct sunlight.</p><h3>What type of touchscreen technology does this kiosk use?</h3><p>It utilizes a 10-point capacitive touchscreen, allowing for precise multi-touch interactions, which is ideal for interactive applications like wayfinding and menu browsing.</p><h3>What operating systems are supported on the Digital Kiosk Interactive 43&quot;?</h3><p>The kiosk supports both Android and Windows operating systems, offering flexibility depending on the required software applications and user interface.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Interactive Digital Kiosk 43\\\" | Brightl