lue\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Tb22,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the main technical specifications of the Digital Kiosk Interactive 43\\\"?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The kiosk features a 43-inch touchscreen with a 10-point capacitive touch panel, supports Android or Windows OS, and has a brightness of 500 nits for clear visibility in various lighting conditions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the Digital Kiosk suitable for indoor and outdoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This model is primarily designed for indoor use in controlled environments like malls, airports, hotels, and restaurants, as the 500-nit brightness is optimized for indoor ambient lighting rather than direct sunlight.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What type of touchscreen technology does this kiosk use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It utilizes a 10-point capacitive touchscreen, allowing for precise multi-touch interactions, which is ideal for interactive applications like wayfinding and menu browsing.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What operating systems are supported on the Digital Kiosk Interactive 43\\\"?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The kiosk supports both Android and Windows operating systems, offering flexibility depending on the required software applications and user interface.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this digital kiosk compare to standard non-interactive digital signage?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike standard digital signage that only displays content, this kiosk offers interactive functionality with touchscreen support, enabling users to actively engage with wayfinding, menus, or other self-service options.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\"